**Company Overview**

Are you looking to join an exciting company for the next phase of your career? Do you work hard and like to be acknowledged for the work you do?

We are an award-winning firm with over twenty-five years of experience in construction management, project/program management, and public outreach. We are looking for a dedicated Civil Inspector to join our amazing team in supporting inspection services.

Provide full-time construction inspection services for large in frastructure project with an award winning public agency.

**Lead Construction Inspector (Civil):**

Desirable Qualifications:

A. 5 years of experience providing construction inspection services for sewer pipelines, urban, underground tunneling or public works/utility construction projects;

B. Experience providing construction inspection services within the last 15 years: (a) for sewer pipelines, water, and/or infrastructure;

C. Five years of experience as a Construction Inspector supervising, managing, and directing other construction inspectors;

D. Experience providing Construction quality control, current construction inspection techniques, and current Occupation Safety and Health Administration (OSHA) and Cal/OSHA safe working practices, rules, and regulations in relation to different types and phases of construction;

E. Experience providing contract plans and specifications for contract administration; performing mathematical computations and applying results to inspection work; and preparing various types of reports and other written communications necessary for recordkeeping and letters to contractors;

